Container images built from this repository are based on Debian/Alpine and
contain operating-system packages under their own licenses (including GPL and
LGPL components such as glibc, bash, coreutils and busybox); their sources are
available from the respective distributions. Each release publishes an SBOM per
image. The web image includes libvips (LGPL-3.0-or-later) via the `sharp`
package, dynamically linked and unmodified; its source is available at
https://github.com/libvips/libvips. The full license texts are in
licenses/LGPL-3.0.txt and licenses/GPL-3.0.txt (/licenses/ in release images,
and attached to each release).
